WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.080
Sahkarmi is a free, open-source desktop app that gives you a team of AI coworkers on your own computer. Here is what it actually does, recorded from the real app.

2
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:31.560
On first launch you choose a default AI. On a clean computer the free built-in model is ready without any account. Claude, ChatGPT and Google Antigravity are optional, and Sahkarmi reuses their existing sign-ins if you have them.

3
00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:49.750
Nine coworkers come ready: accounts, sales, support, research, content, code, ops, security, and an orchestrator. Each has its own folder, memory and task queue. Rename them or add your own.

4
00:00:49.752 --> 00:01:04.652
Give a task in plain language. Here Vikram, the sales coworker, drafts a WhatsApp follow-up on the free model. Every step shows in the thread, and you can pause or stop at any time.

5
00:01:04.656 --> 00:01:10.916
Control K searches every coworker and every message, and jumps straight to it.

6
00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:22.340
Each coworker has its own built-in browser. For logins and OTPs you press Take over and type them yourself; the coworker waits until you hand back.

7
00:01:22.344 --> 00:01:36.244
Before a payment, a customer message, a post or a form, a coworker files a request in Approvals and waits for your decision. The Permissions page sets how much they may do on their own.

8
00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:50.810
Settings, AI and models: connect the accounts you already pay for, or stay on the free models. Your password is only ever typed on the provider's own page, and nothing is sent to Sahkarmi.

9
00:01:50.808 --> 00:02:06.718
Download it from sahkarmi dot site for Windows, macOS or Linux. The Windows installer is not code-signed yet, so choose More info, then Run anyway. Checksums are on the release page.

10
00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:20.500
Sahkarmi is a young open-source project. Try it, tell us what broke or confused you on GitHub, and help shape it. Your AI team. Made in India.

